[N 11-15 Loch Modan]
[D Forever Druid 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Loch Modan first pass in Bear Form: Valley of Kings, Thelsamar, a flight to Ironforge for the Hall of Thanes pickups and the Journeyman trainers (no druid trainer there), the north loop, the Snowbound jar run and the south caves.]
