[OC]|cffffffffLoch Modan 11-15|r
[OC]|cffffcc00Carry-over log:|r Old Ironforge Incursion (96393, Hall of Thanes), Exploring the Alliance (93963: all four names done - Bolvar on the Westfall chapter's Stormwind pass), Journey to Sentinel Hill (98021: Gryan in Westfall).
[OC]|cffffcc00Launch rule (11-15):|r no shared tags in Forever - on a camped named mob or object INVITE the people standing there (kill credit shares in a party; most drop items don't). If no group forms in ~2 min, tick the step and keep moving; the catch-up line at the end of the chapter says where chapter 16-17 brings you back.

[OC]|cffffffffValley of Kings|r  -  the bunker right outside South Gate Pass
[OC]|cffffcc00Mining:|r your Mining starts here - Zephras Isle had no ore, so mine every Copper Vein you pass from now on (no Lodestone: Camping 101: Mining was not taken on the island)
Outside the bunker at [TAR1089 Mountaineer Cobbleflint], [QA224 In Defense of the King's Lands] [G22.1,73.1 Loch Modan]
At the top of the bunker at [TAR1092 Captain Rugelfuss], [QA267 The Trogg Threat] [G23.2,73.7 Loch Modan]
[OC]No vendor at the bunker - Thelsamar is the first shop in the zone


[OC]Grind the trogg valley below the shrine
Kill 10 [TAR1161 Stonesplinter Trogg] and 10 [TAR1162 Stonesplinter Scout] [QC224] [G31,68 Loch Modan]
Loot 8 Trogg Stone Teeth from any Stonesplinter trogg [QC267] [G31,68 Loch Modan]

[OC]Run back southwest to the bunker
Outside at [TAR1089 Mountaineer Cobbleflint], [QT224] [G22.1,73.1 Loch Modan]
At the top at [TAR1092 Captain Rugelfuss], [QT267] [G23.2,73.7 Loch Modan]
Outside at [TAR1091 Mountaineer Gravelgaw], [QA237 In Defense of the King's Lands] [G23.5,76.4 Loch Modan]
Kill 10 [TAR1163 Stonesplinter Skullthumper] and 10 [TAR1166 Stonesplinter Seer] in the south half of the valley (level 13-14, pull one at a time) [QC237] [G36,80 Loch Modan]
Bandage to 50: Linen Bandages from the trogg cloth until First Aid 40-50 before the Ironforge trip (Linen goes green at 45 and grey at 60 - Classic colours, unverified; about 40-50 cloth) - Journeyman and Heavy Linen both wait at Nissa [G36,80 Loch Modan]
Outside at [TAR1091 Mountaineer Gravelgaw], [QT237] [G23.5,76.4 Loch Modan]
Inside at [TAR1090 Mountaineer Wallbang], [QA263 In Defense of the King's Lands] (level 15-16 troggs - it waits until the end of this chapter) [G23.5,74.5 Loch Modan]

